[{"answer":"Sorry to keep you waiting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, firstly, let me give you this booklet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/2.mp3"},{"answer":"It tells you a bit more about the school,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/3.mp3"},{"answer":"the courses and the social activities we offer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, on the first page,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/5.mp3"},{"answer":"there's an outline of this morning's activities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/6.mp3"},{"answer":"There, you see?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/7.mp3"},{"answer":"The programme starts at 10 o'clock.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Try not to be late as it's a very full day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/9.mp3"},{"answer":"At 10 o'clock, all the new students will gather in the Main Hall","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/10.mp3"},{"answer":"to meet the Principal and the rest of the staff.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/11.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, you spend most of the morning in the Main Hall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Where's that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll show you in a minute.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Just let me quickly run through this morning's events first","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/15.mp3"},{"answer":"and then I'll explain how to get there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. Where were we?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, so, the Principal's talk will last about 15 minutes","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/19.mp3"},{"answer":"and then the Director of Studies will talk to you for half an hour about the courses","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/20.mp3"},{"answer":"and the different requirements for each.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/21.mp3"},{"answer":"After that, the Student Adviser will tell you about the various services and activities we offer to students.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Any questions?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/23.mp3"},{"answer":"So, all of this is in the Main Hall?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/24.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/25.mp3"},{"answer":"And then you'll go next door to Classroom 5 at 11 o'clock.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/26.mp3"},{"answer":"What happens there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/27.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll have a test.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Test?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't like the sound of that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/30.mp3"},{"answer":"What sort of test?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, it's nothing to worry about.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/32.mp3"},{"answer":"It's just a placement test to help us find your level of English","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/33.mp3"},{"answer":"so that we can put you in the right class.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/34.mp3"},{"answer":"It won't last long.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/35.mp3"},{"answer":"But how do I find the Main Hall?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Right; if you look on the back of the booklet I gave you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/37.mp3"},{"answer":"you'll see a map of the school.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me show you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Look; you came in through the Main Entrance, here,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/40.mp3"},{"answer":"and now we're here at Reception.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, to get to the Main Hall,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/42.mp3"},{"answer":"you walk on to the end of this corridor in front of you","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/43.mp3"},{"answer":"and then you turn left.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Walk along past the Language Laboratory","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/45.mp3"},{"answer":"and then past the Library,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/46.mp3"},{"answer":"which is next to the Language Lab, on the same side,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/47.mp3"},{"answer":"and facing you is the Main Hall, at the end of the corridor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/48.mp3"},{"answer":"You can't miss it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/49.mp3"},{"answer":"So it's next to the Library, in fact.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I should be able to find that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/52.mp3"},{"answer":"And do you have a Computer Laboratory?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, we do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you tell me where that is?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Certainly, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/56.mp3"},{"answer":"You go down to the end of this corridor again","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/57.mp3"},{"answer":"but, this time, don't turn left;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/58.mp3"},{"answer":"turn right, away from the Main Hall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/59.mp3"},{"answer":"The Computer Lab. is immediately on your right. Okay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/60.mp3"},{"answer":"And where's the staff room, in case I need to find a teacher at some stage?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/61.mp3"},{"answer":"The staff room is near the main entrance,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/62.mp3"},{"answer":"on the left over there, just opposite the Reception desk.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/63.mp3"},{"answer":"In a day or two, I'm sure you'll find your way around very easily.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, one last thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there a student common room?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes, I forgot to mention that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/67.mp3"},{"answer":"It's this area here,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/68-2025-02-15-09-39-43.mp3"},{"answer":"very close to where we are now,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/69.mp3"},{"answer":"to the right of the Reception desk as you come in the main entrance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/70.mp3"},{"answer":"There's tea and coffee facilities there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you very much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/73.mp3"},{"answer":"You're welcome.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-1-2023-08-15-21-27-01/74.mp3"}]
